      {
        "title": "Act Clear",
        "text": "The Act Clear jingle of Sonic the Hedgehog 2 (Sega, 1992) is a six-second fanfare that plays when Sonic finishes an act. Sega Retro credits it to Masato Nakamura."
      },
      {
        "title": "Eleven zones, twenty acts",
        "text": "According to Wikipedia, Sonic the Hedgehog 2 has eleven zones with twenty acts in all. Most zones have two acts, and the last act of each zone ends with a boss battle against Dr. Robotnik."
